# UI

- User-facing intelligence name is **Archie’s Intelligence**. Do not show “SHI.”
- Maps are sacred: chrome must not steal pan, draw, or tiles.
- Story Glass sound stays original Web Audio. Do not mute by default or replace with stock SFX.
- Typography and surfaces follow existing Story OS tokens. Do not redesign the brand unless asked.
- After UI changes, verify the real click path, not only a screenshot.
